<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper A · Answer guide</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Paper A · Answer guide</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. How old is Wang Ming?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 大家好，我叫王明。我今年十七岁，在明华学校上学。我哥哥十九岁，他在上海学习。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十六岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十七岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十九岁</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Wang Ming explicitly says he is seventeen.</p><p class="cn">王明说自己今年十七岁。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我今年十七岁</p><ul><li>A: Sixteen is not the age given.<br>稿件没有说王明十六岁。</li><li>C: Nineteen is his older brother’s age.<br>十九岁是哥哥的年龄。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. What does the speaker’s mother do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我家有四个人。爸爸是老师，妈妈是医生。我和弟弟都是学生。妈妈每天早上八点去医院。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 医生</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学生</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The mother is identified as a doctor.</p><p class="cn">妈妈的工作是医生。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 妈妈是医生</p><ul><li>B: The father, not the mother, is a teacher.<br>老师是爸爸的工作。</li><li>C: The speaker and younger brother are students.<br>学生指说话者和弟弟。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Who is fifteen years old?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 这是我妹妹的照片，她今年十五岁，喜欢唱歌。我弟弟只有九岁，喜欢画画。我每天和妹妹一起上学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妹妹</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The younger sister is explicitly fifteen.</p><p class="cn">说话者明确说妹妹十五岁。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我妹妹的照片，她今年十五岁</p><ul><li>A: The younger brother is nine.<br>弟弟九岁，不是十五岁。</li><li>B: No older brother is described.<br>材料没有介绍哥哥。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Where is Li An from?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 我叫李安，是韩国人。现在我在北京学中文。我们班的老师是中国人，我的好朋友是美国人。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中国</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 韩国</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 美国</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Li An introduces herself as Korean.</p><p class="cn">李安说自己是韩国人。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我叫李安，是韩国人</p><ul><li>A: The teacher is Chinese; Li An is not described that way.<br>中国人指老师。</li><li>C: Her friend, rather than Li An, is American.<br>美国人指她的好朋友。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Where is the speaker waiting?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 我是明华学校的学生。今天是星期一，我在学校门口等朋友。她是新同学，今天第一次来这里上课。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 家门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 商店门口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学校门口</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>He says he is waiting at the school entrance.</p><p class="cn">他明确说在学校门口等朋友。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我在学校门口等朋友</p><ul><li>A: The speaker is not waiting at home.<br>说话者没有在家门口等人。</li><li>B: No shop is mentioned.<br>材料没有提到商店。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. What does the boy need for class?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 上课要用铅笔。你有铅笔吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 我只有一支钢笔，没有铅笔。</p><p class="cn">female · 你可以先用我的，我有两支铅笔。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 铅笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 钢笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 尺子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The class requires a pencil, and he does not have one.</p><p class="cn">上课要用铅笔，男生没有。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 上课要用铅笔</p><ul><li>B: He already has a pen; it is not the requested item.<br>男生已有钢笔，但课堂需要铅笔。</li><li>C: A ruler is not mentioned.<br>材料没有提到尺子。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Which book does the boy want to borrow?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 你的中文书能借我看一下吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 可以，书在桌子上。</p><p class="cn">male · 谢谢。我的中文书在家里，英语书在书包里。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 英语书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 数学书</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中文书</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>He directly asks to borrow the Chinese book.</p><p class="cn">男生直接提出借中文书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 你的中文书能借我看一下吗</p><ul><li>A: His English book is already in his bag.<br>他的英语书已经在书包里。</li><li>B: No mathematics book is requested.<br>他没有提出借数学书。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Which classroom should the girl go to?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 老师，今天在哪儿上课？</p><p class="cn">male · 在三楼的三零二教室，不是二楼。</p><p class="cn">female · 好的，我现在去三楼等同学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二楼201</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三楼302</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四楼402</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The room is 302 on the third floor.</p><p class="cn">教室是三楼302。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 在三楼的三零二教室</p><ul><li>A: The teacher explicitly says not the second floor.<br>老师明确说不是二楼。</li><li>C: No fourth-floor room is given.<br>材料没有说去四楼。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. What will the girl do first after class?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 下课后你去哪儿？去食堂吃饭吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 我先去图书馆借书，然后回家。今天我不在学校吃饭。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 借书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 吃饭</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 买衣服</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>She will first borrow books at the library.</p><p class="cn">女生说先去图书馆借书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我先去图书馆借书</p><ul><li>B: She says she is not eating at school today.<br>她今天不在学校吃饭，吃饭也不是先做的事。</li><li>C: Buying clothes is not mentioned.<br>材料没有提到买衣服。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When does today’s Chinese class begin?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 今天的中文课还是九点开始吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 不是，今天九点半开始，十点半下课。</p><p class="cn">female · 好，那我九点二十到教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 九点半</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The boy says class begins at nine thirty today.</p><p class="cn">男生说明今天九点半开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天九点半开始</p><ul><li>A: Nine is the suggested time that is corrected.<br>九点是被否定的原先时间。</li><li>B: Ten thirty is the end of class.<br>十点半是下课时间。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What does the girl want to eat now?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 中午吃什么？你想吃面条吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 晚上我想吃面条。现在我想吃米饭和鸡蛋，不想吃肉。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 米饭和鸡蛋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 米饭和肉</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>She chooses rice and eggs for now.</p><p class="cn">她现在想吃米饭和鸡蛋。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 现在我想吃米饭和鸡蛋</p><ul><li>A: Noodles are her choice for the evening.<br>面条是她晚上想吃的。</li><li>C: She explicitly does not want meat.<br>她说现在不想吃肉。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. What does the speaker drink every morning?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 早上妈妈喝茶，爸爸喝咖啡。我不喝茶，也不喝咖啡。我每天喝一杯牛奶，然后去上学。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 咖啡</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The speaker says she drinks milk every day.</p><p class="cn">说话者每天喝一杯牛奶。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我每天喝一杯牛奶</p><ul><li>B: Tea is her mother’s drink, not hers.<br>茶是妈妈喝的，她自己不喝。</li><li>C: Coffee is her father’s drink, not hers.<br>咖啡是爸爸喝的，她自己不喝。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. How many apples does the boy want?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 你要几个苹果？</p><p class="cn">male · 我要四个苹果，再要两个香蕉。</p><p class="cn">female · 好的，四个苹果、两个香蕉，放在这个袋子里。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两个</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六个</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 四个</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>He requests four apples, repeated by the seller.</p><p class="cn">他要四个苹果，卖家也重复确认。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我要四个苹果</p><ul><li>A: Two is the number of bananas.<br>两个是香蕉的数量。</li><li>B: Six would combine both fruits, not just apples.<br>六个把两种水果加在一起，不是苹果数量。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. How much does the lunch cost?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 这份午饭多少钱？</p><p class="cn">female · 十二块。</p><p class="cn">male · 给你二十块。</p><p class="cn">female · 谢谢，找你八块。你的午饭在桌子上。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十二块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八块</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The seller states that lunch costs twelve.</p><p class="cn">卖家直接说午饭十二块。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 十二块</p><ul><li>A: Twenty is the amount handed over.<br>二十块是顾客付出的纸币金额。</li><li>C: Eight is the change returned.<br>八块是找回的零钱。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which color does the boy choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 你喜欢这件红色的衣服吗？</p><p class="cn">male · 我喜欢蓝色的，不喜欢红色的。蓝色这件也不大，我就买这件吧。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 蓝色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 红色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白色</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>He chooses the blue item.</p><p class="cn">他说喜欢蓝色，并决定买蓝色这件。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我喜欢蓝色的，不喜欢红色的</p><ul><li>B: He explicitly does not like red.<br>他明确说不喜欢红色。</li><li>C: White is not offered or selected in the dialogue.<br>对话没有提供或选择白色。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. When will they meet?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 星期六一起去看电影，好吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 星期六我要上课。星期天下午我有时间。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，我们星期天下午见。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期六上午</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期六下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期天下午</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Both agree on Sunday afternoon.</p><p class="cn">双方最后约定周日下午见。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我们星期天下午见</p><ul><li>A: Saturday is unavailable because she has class.<br>女生周六要上课，没有约在周六上午。</li><li>B: They do not agree to meet on Saturday.<br>他们没有同意周六下午见。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When does the boy leave home?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 你早上几点出门？</p><p class="cn">male · 我六点半起床，七点吃早饭，七点半出门。学校很近，八点以前就能到。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>He leaves home at seven thirty.</p><p class="cn">他七点半出门。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 七点半出门</p><ul><li>A: Six thirty is his waking time.<br>六点半是起床时间。</li><li>C: Seven is his breakfast time.<br>七点是吃早饭的时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What will the girl wear?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 今天外面很冷，你穿这件衣服去学校吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 不穿这件薄的。我穿那件厚外套。</p><p class="cn">male · 好，别忘了你的书包。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 厚外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 薄衣服</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 短裤</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>She chooses the thick coat for the cold weather.</p><p class="cn">她决定穿厚外套。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我穿那件厚外套</p><ul><li>B: She explicitly rejects the thin item.<br>她明确说不穿这件薄的。</li><li>C: Shorts are not mentioned.<br>材料没有提到短裤。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What do they agree to do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">female · 下午一起去打篮球吧？</p><p class="cn">male · 我不太会打篮球。我想去公园走走，你去吗？</p><p class="cn">female · 好，我也想去公园。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 打篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 去公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看电视</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Both agree to go to the park.</p><p class="cn">两人最后都同意去公园。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 好，我也想去公园</p><ul><li>A: Basketball is suggested first, but not chosen.<br>篮球是最初建议，最后没有选择。</li><li>C: Watching television is not mentioned.<br>材料没有提到看电视。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the girl do on Saturday afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1a-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">male · 周末你喜欢做什么？</p><p class="cn">female · 我喜欢画画，也喜欢听音乐。这周六下午我要在家画画。星期天再去听音乐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 听音乐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 唱歌</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>She will draw at home on Saturday afternoon.</p><p class="cn">她周六下午在家画画。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 这周六下午我要在家画画</p><ul><li>B: Listening to music is planned for Sunday.<br>听音乐安排在星期天。</li><li>C: Singing is not in her stated plan.<br>她没有说计划唱歌。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. Where is Jin Na from?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新同学：金娜<br>年龄：十六岁<br>来自：韩国<br>学校：明华学校<br>家人：爸爸、妈妈、弟弟<br>爱好：听音乐</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中国</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 美国</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 韩国</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The origin field gives Korea.</p><p class="cn">来自一栏写的是韩国。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 来自：韩国</p><ul><li>A: China is not the country listed on the profile.<br>资料卡没有把中国列为来源国家。</li><li>B: The profile does not say she is from the United States.<br>资料卡没有说她来自美国。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. Who studies at university?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小雨，你好！我爸爸在学校教中文，妈妈在医院工作，是医生。我哥哥在大学读书。我还在中学上学。<br>王宁</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爸爸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妈妈</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The older brother studies at university.</p><p class="cn">原文说哥哥在大学读书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我哥哥在大学读书</p><ul><li>A: The father teaches Chinese at school.<br>爸爸在学校教中文。</li><li>C: The mother is a doctor working at a hospital.<br>妈妈是医院的医生。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How old is the younger sister?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">照片上是我和妹妹。我今年十六岁，妹妹十二岁。她喜欢红色，我喜欢蓝色。我们星期天常常一起去公园。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十二岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十六岁</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十四岁</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The note explicitly gives the younger sister’s age as twelve.</p><p class="cn">照片说明明确写妹妹十二岁。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 妹妹十二岁</p><ul><li>B: Sixteen is the writer’s own age.<br>十六岁是作者自己的年龄。</li><li>C: Fourteen is not given in the note.<br>原文没有出现十四岁。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who lives with Anna in Beijing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">你好，我是安娜。我现在和爸爸妈妈住在北京。哥哥在上海工作，不和我们一起住。我们星期日晚上给哥哥打电话。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爷爷奶奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸妈妈</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Anna says she lives with her parents.</p><p class="cn">安娜说自己和爸爸妈妈住在北京。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我现在和爸爸妈妈住在北京</p><ul><li>A: Her older brother works in Shanghai and lives separately.<br>哥哥在上海工作，不与她同住。</li><li>B: Grandparents are not listed as living with her.<br>原文没有说爷爷奶奶和她住。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Which class is Lin Ming joining?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">新同学林明：<br>欢迎来二班！我们在三楼302教室上课。请带中文书。今天九点上课，老师姓王。<br>二班班长 小李</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一班</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二班</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三班</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The welcome and signature both identify Class Two.</p><p class="cn">欢迎语和署名都说明是二班。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 欢迎来二班</p><ul><li>A: The note does not welcome him to Class One.<br>便条不是欢迎他到一班。</li><li>C: The third floor is a location, not the class number.<br>三楼是楼层，不是三班。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Which item do students NOT need to bring?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同学们：<br>明天有画画课，请带铅笔和彩色笔。老师有纸，大家不用带纸。书包请放在桌子下面。<br>刘老师</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 纸</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 铅笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 彩色笔</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The teacher supplies paper and says not to bring it.</p><p class="cn">老师有纸，明确说大家不用带。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 大家不用带纸</p><ul><li>B: Students are explicitly asked to bring pencils.<br>通知要求带铅笔。</li><li>C: Students are explicitly asked to bring colored pens.<br>通知要求带彩色笔。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which lesson starts at ten o’clock?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">星期二上午课表<br>中文：9:00—9:40<br>英语：10:00—10:40<br>数学：11:00—11:40<br>请在上课前到教室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 中文</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 数学</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 英语</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>English is the ten-o’clock lesson.</p><p class="cn">课表写英语十点开始。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 英语：10:00—10:40</p><ul><li>A: Chinese begins at nine.<br>中文九点开始。</li><li>B: Mathematics begins at eleven.<br>数学十一点开始。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. Where should Xiao Chen collect the book?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陈：<br>你的书我看完了。今天下课后我把书放在王老师的桌子上。请你去办公室拿，不用来我们教室。<br>小周</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小周的教室</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 办公室</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 图书馆</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The book is to be collected in the office.</p><p class="cn">便条让小陈去办公室拿书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请你去办公室拿</p><ul><li>A: The writer explicitly says not to come to their classroom.<br>小周明确说不用来自己教室。</li><li>C: The library is not the collection location.<br>便条没有安排在图书馆取书。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. What does Li Xiaowen ask to borrow?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">老师：<br>我的中文书在家里，英语书在书包里。今天能借您的中文书用一下吗？下课后我就还给您。<br>李小文</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 英语书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 书包</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 中文书</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The writer directly asks to use the teacher’s Chinese book.</p><p class="cn">学生直接请求借老师的中文书。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天能借您的中文书用一下吗</p><ul><li>A: The English book is already in the bag.<br>英语书已在书包里，不是借用目标。</li><li>B: The writer does not ask for a bag.<br>便条没有提出借书包。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does Xiao Lin play basketball?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的一周<br>星期一下午：在学校打篮球<br>星期三下午：在图书馆看书<br>星期六上午：和妈妈买水果<br>星期天：在家休息</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期一下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期三下午</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期六上午</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The schedule lists basketball on Monday afternoon.</p><p class="cn">安排表把篮球放在周一下午。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 星期一下午：在学校打篮球</p><ul><li>B: Wednesday afternoon is for reading at the library.<br>周三下午是在图书馆看书。</li><li>C: Saturday morning is for buying fruit.<br>周六上午是和妈妈买水果。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How much are the noodles?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">学校食堂菜单<br>米饭：四元<br>面条：六元<br>鸡蛋：两元<br>牛奶：五元<br>中午十一点开始卖，下午一点结束。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 四元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五元</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The menu prices noodles at six yuan.</p><p class="cn">菜单标明面条六元。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 面条：六元</p><ul><li>A: Four yuan is the price of rice.<br>四元是米饭价格。</li><li>C: Five yuan is the price of milk.<br>五元是牛奶价格。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. What does Xiao An want for lunch?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">妈妈：<br>今天午饭我想吃米饭和鸡蛋，不要肉。妹妹想吃面条。请再给我买一瓶水，谢谢！我十二点回家。<br>小安</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 米饭和鸡蛋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 面条</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 米饭和肉</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>Xiao An’s message requests rice and eggs.</p><p class="cn">小安在便条中要米饭和鸡蛋。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 今天午饭我想吃米饭和鸡蛋</p><ul><li>B: The younger sister wants noodles.<br>面条是妹妹想吃的。</li><li>C: Xiao An explicitly says not to include meat.<br>小安明确说不要肉。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. What should Dad buy TWO of?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">爸爸：<br>家里还有三个苹果，今天不用买苹果。请买两个香蕉和四个橙子。香蕉给妹妹，橙子我们一起吃。<br>小美</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 苹果</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 橙子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 香蕉</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The shopping note requests two bananas.</p><p class="cn">便条明确要求买两个香蕉。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请买两个香蕉</p><ul><li>A: Apples are already at home and should not be bought today.<br>家里已有苹果，今天不用买。</li><li>B: The note requests four oranges.<br>橙子要买四个。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. What drink does Xiaowen request?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小李：<br>今天有点儿冷，我不想喝冷水。请给我一杯热茶，不加糖。你的咖啡在桌子上。我在教室等你。<br>小文</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 冷水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 热茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 咖啡</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>The request is for a cup of hot tea without sugar.</p><p class="cn">小文要一杯不加糖的热茶。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 请给我一杯热茶</p><ul><li>A: The writer explicitly does not want cold water.<br>小文明确说不想喝冷水。</li><li>C: The coffee belongs to Xiao Li, not the writer’s request.<br>咖啡是小李的，不是小文要的饮料。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. Which shirt does the writer want?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小青：<br>商店里有蓝色和白色的衬衫。我喜欢蓝色的，要小号。白色那件太大了，我不买。请你帮我看看蓝色小号多少钱。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 蓝色大号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝色小号</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>Both the preferred color and size match.</p><p class="cn">蓝色小号同时符合颜色和尺码要求。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 我喜欢蓝色的，要小号</p><ul><li>A: The writer rejects the large white shirt.<br>作者不买太大的白色衬衫。</li><li>B: Blue is right, but the writer wants a small size.<br>颜色对，但作者要小号，不是大号。</li></ul></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When do they finally agree to meet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小白：周六上午来我家，好吗？<br>小林：周六我有课。周日上午九点可以吗？<br>小白：可以，我九点在家等你。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周日上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周六上午九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周日上午十点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The second message proposes Sunday at nine and the last accepts it.</p><p class="cn">小林提出周日九点，小白随后同意。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周日上午九点可以吗</p><ul><li>B: Saturday is unavailable because Xiao Lin has class.<br>小林周六有课，双方没有约在周六九点。</li><li>C: The agreed hour is nine, not ten.<br>约定的是上午九点，不是十点。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. When does the writer take the bus?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我的早上<br>六点起床，六点半吃早饭，七点坐公共汽车去学校。八点开始上课。爸爸七点半出门去工作。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 七点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 七点</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: C</b><p>The writer takes the bus at seven.</p><p class="cn">作者七点坐公共汽车。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 七点坐公共汽车去学校</p><ul><li>A: Six thirty is breakfast time.<br>六点半是吃早饭时间。</li><li>B: Seven thirty is Dad’s leaving time.<br>七点半是爸爸出门时间。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which item of clothing should Xiaoyu take from home?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小雨：<br>今天很热。去公园时请带帽子和水，不用带厚外套。你的蓝帽子在门口，白帽子在学校。<br>妈妈</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 厚外套</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 蓝帽子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 白帽子</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>A hat is requested, and the blue one is at home by the door.</p><p class="cn">需要带帽子，蓝帽子在家门口。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 你的蓝帽子在门口，白帽子在学校</p><ul><li>A: The note explicitly says no thick coat is needed.<br>便条明确说不用带厚外套。</li><li>C: The white hat is at school, not at home.<br>白帽子在学校，不在家里。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What will they do together on Sunday afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小周：周日下午一起去看电影吗？<br>小陈：好啊！我上午要打篮球，下午有空。<br>小周：那我们两点在电影院门口见。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 看电影</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 在家看书</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: A</b><p>The invitation to see a film is accepted for the afternoon.</p><p class="cn">小陈同意了下午看电影的邀请。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 周日下午一起去看电影吗</p><ul><li>B: Basketball is Xiao Chen’s morning activity.<br>篮球是小陈上午的安排。</li><li>C: Reading at home is not the agreed activity.<br>对话没有约定在家看书。</li></ul></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. Which activity fits Xiaohong’s preference and free time?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">学校活动<br>画画：星期二下午，王老师教。<br>唱歌：星期四下午，刘老师教。<br>小红喜欢画画，不喜欢唱歌。她周二下午有空。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 星期四唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 星期二画画</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 星期二唱歌</div></div><div class="key"><b>Answer: B</b><p>Drawing matches both her preference and Tuesday availability.</p><p class="cn">周二画画同时符合喜好和空闲时间。</p><p class="cn">Evidence: 画画：星期二下午</p><ul><li>A: She dislikes singing; her stated free time is Tuesday.<br>她不喜欢唱歌，明确有空的是周二下午。</li><li>C: The school does not list singing on Tuesday.<br>学校没有列出周二唱歌活动。</li></ul></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to an invitation</h2><p>Your classmate sent the message below. Reply in Chinese. Say whether you can come on Saturday, give a time or another day that works for you, and ask one relevant question. You may invent personal details. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：你好！星期六来我家吃午饭，好吗？你想吃米饭还是面条？你几点有空？<br>小周</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">小周，你好！周六可以。我想吃面条，十一点有空。你家在哪儿？谢谢！</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Saturday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or suggest another day.</li><li>Ask one question related to the visit.</li></ul><h3>Alternative example</h3><p class="cn">你好！周六我有课，周日可以吗？我十二点有空。你家在哪儿？</p><ul><li>Accept a polite decline plus an alternative day; acceptance is not required.</li><li>Names and personal details may differ.</li><li>A relevant question about location, arrival or food can meet the question requirement.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a student</h2><p>Use the fictional profile below to introduce Lin An in Chinese. Include the person’s name and age, school and class starting time, and at least one preference. Write connected simple sentences. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. Do not substitute your own private information.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：林安<br>年龄：十六岁<br>学校：明华学校<br>上课：上午九点<br>喜欢：画画、米饭<br>不喜欢：咖啡</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">这是林安，今年十六岁。林安在明华学校上学，上午九点开始上课。林安喜欢画画，也喜欢吃米饭。林安不喜欢喝咖啡。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Lin An by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and the class starting time.</li><li>State at least one preference consistently with the card.</li></ul><ul><li>All facts come from the fictional card; gender need not be inferred.</li><li>Any one listed preference meets that requirement.</li><li>A list copied without sentences gives less evidence of organization; do not impose an arbitrary length penalty.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Meet a classmate</h2><p>Respond in Chinese to four recorded prompts. Each prompt plays twice, followed by 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Use real or invented information. The four responses form ONE task, reviewed together out of eight. These are fixed prompts, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A new classmate asks about you and proposes an activity. Listen to the questions rather than reading their transcripts.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你好！你叫什么名字？今年多大？</p><p class="cn">Example: 你好，我叫李安，今年十六岁。</p><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你喜欢吃什么？喜欢喝什么？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我喜欢吃面条，喜欢喝牛奶。</p><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">你早上几点去学校？几点上课？</p><p class="cn">Example: 我七点半去学校，八点上课。</p><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="cn">星期六一起去公园，好吗？你几点有空？</p><p class="cn">Example: 好啊！我星期六下午两点有空。</p><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Tell a classmate about a school day</h2><p>Introduce the fictional student’s day in Chinese using the card. Include who the student is, when and where the student studies, and one after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. Simple sentences are enough; no minimum recording length is enforced.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">姓名：王宁<br>学校：明华学校<br>八点：在学校上课<br>十二点：吃午饭<br>下午三点：下课<br>下课后：去公园走走</p></div><div class="key"><h3>Illustrative response - other valid responses are possible</h3><p class="cn">这是王宁。王宁在明华学校上学，早上八点开始上课。十二点吃午饭，下午三点下课。下课以后，王宁去公园走走。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Wang Ning.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time from the card.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity.</li></ul><ul><li>Not all times must be recited to meet the task.</li><li>Short comprehensible sentences are sufficient; a native-like accent or a full sixty-second answer is not required.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box"><h2>Self / teacher review rubric</h2><p>Four dimensions × 0–2 points = /8 per task. Review S1 as one complete four-response task. No combined percentage, pass line, official equivalence or included teacher-marking service.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>0</th><th>1</th><th>2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>任务完成</td><td>无相关可评内容。</td><td>回应部分要求，遗漏关键信息。</td><td>以初阶表达回应主要要求。</td></tr><tr><td>可理解性</td><td>大部分意思无法恢复。</td><td>部分需借助上下文猜测。</td><td>主要意思能够理解。</td></tr><tr><td>基础语言运用</td><td>缺少可用于表达目标意思的中文。</td><td>有限词句传达部分意思，错误有时干扰。</td><td>简单词句基本适合情境，允许初阶错误。</td></tr><tr><td>组织／相关回应</td><td>缺乏可辨关系或相关回应。</td><td>有部分顺序或相关回应。</td><td>简单但连贯，回应相关、易于跟随。</td></tr></tbody></table></section></main></body></html>